{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46204","headline":"山居诗二十四首 十八 · 贯休","name":"山居诗二十四首 十八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"业薪心火日烧煎，浪死虚生自古然。\n陆氏称龙终妄矣，汉家得鹿更空焉。\n白衣居士深深说，青眼胡僧远远传。\n刚地无人知此意，不堪惆怅落花前。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46204.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46204","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}